.TH SIMPLE_SHELL 1 "August 2026" "Simple Shell" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
simple_shell - a simple UNIX command interpreter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./hsh

.SH DESCRIPTION
Simple Shell is a simple UNIX command interpreter written in C.

It reads commands from the standard input and executes them.

.SH COMPILATION
Compile the shell with:

.B gcc -Wall -Werror -Wextra -pedantic -std=gnu89 *.c -o hsh

.SH USAGE
Run the shell with:

.B ./hsh

Example:

.B /bin/ls

